Q: input type=&quot;date&quot; appears larger on iPhone A: <p>Checked it on LT Browser, looks really fine. In case you are still facing issue, you can use media query as</p>
<pre><code>@media (max-width: 425px) {
    input[type=&quot;date&quot;] {
        height: your preferred;
        width: your preferred;
    }
}
</code></pre>
<p>You can adjust values according to your own wish as it suits best.</p>
